## SQ-SALT2-08 | an edited salt-common.toml is carried into creativedelight-common.toml once, renamed .moved, not recreated
@group A
@commands Restart with an edited `config/salt-common.toml` (`EvaporationChance = 0.5`) and no `[salt]` in `creativedelight-common.toml`
@pass Log `config/salt-common.toml carried into config/creativedelight-common.toml (19 values)`; file renamed `.moved`; `[salt]` holds 0.5; no `salt-common.toml` recreated; a salted food listed in `SaltingFoodValues` gets that value (AppleSkin); `/reload` after editing `[salt]` applies
@fails Salt member `Configuration` (`-03`), CD `compat/SaltConfigBridge`, `MemberConfigMove`; salt.md 6 S10
@jars creativecommon creativedelight
@tier T2
@reviewed 2026-11-20
@from batches/r1113/fix_c1a1.qb
# r1120fix (2026-11-20): own fixture. The pack ships salt-common.toml.moved and a full [salt] in creativedelight-common.toml;
# MemberConfigMove.carry skips a key the target already holds, so the edit restores salt-common.toml from the .moved copy
# (EvaporationChance 0.3 -> 0.5) and drops every [salt] / [salt.*] table from creativedelight-common.toml (kept as .r1120bak),
# then restarts. The row puts the pack copy back at the end (the running server keeps 0.5 until its next boot).
edit cp config/creativedelight-common.toml config/creativedelight-common.toml.r1120bak && cp config/salt-common.toml.moved config/salt-common.toml && sed -i -E 's/^([[:space:]]*EvaporationChance = )0\.3[[:space:]]*$/\10.5/' config/salt-common.toml && grep -qE "EvaporationChance = 0\.5" config/salt-common.toml && awk '/^[[:space:]]*\[/{skip=($0 ~ /^[[:space:]]*\[salt(\.[^]]*)?\][[:space:]]*$/)} !skip' config/creativedelight-common.toml.r1120bak > config/creativedelight-common.toml && ! grep -qE "^[[:space:]]*\[salt" config/creativedelight-common.toml && rm config/salt-common.toml.moved
restart
bootexpect \[creativedelight\] config/salt-common.toml carried into config/creativedelight-common.toml \(19 values\)
bootreject could not carry|could not rename
shell grep -h "salt-common.toml carried" logs/latest.log | cut -c1-300
shell ls config | grep -i "^salt-"; test -f config/salt-common.toml.moved && test ! -f config/salt-common.toml && echo SALT2-08-FILES-OK
shell awk '/^[[:space:]]*\[/{s=$0} s ~ /^[[:space:]]*\[salt\.Evaporation\][[:space:]]*$/ && /EvaporationChance/' config/creativedelight-common.toml | grep -E "EvaporationChance = 0\.5"
shell cp config/creativedelight-common.toml config/creativedelight-common.toml.carried && cp config/creativedelight-common.toml.r1120bak config/creativedelight-common.toml
look carried line says 19 values; ls shows salt-client.toml and salt-common.toml.moved only, then SALT2-08-FILES-OK; [salt.Evaporation] EvaporationChance = 0.5 (the carried file is kept as creativedelight-common.toml.carried)

